;    1: TDecorate(count=4, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=0, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=めいちょう, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    2: TDecorate(count=2, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=0, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=こごおり, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    3: TDecorate(count=4, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=0, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=にいむらはるか, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    4: TDecorate(count=2, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=0, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=・・, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
; Display conditions:
;    0: TWdCondition(count=1003, target=)
; Links:
;    0: TWdLink(count=964, event=, unk3=)
;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{MESON "-1"}
{CREATECG "プレート" "グラフィック\システム\立木三日プレート.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "180" "380" "600" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>Thank you very much.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then, <VAR NAME="プレイヤー名" unk3="50">-sama, for a while it will be just the two of us in this world, you and I, but I am most humbly in your hands.<PG>
Now, the reason <VAR NAME="プレイヤー名" unk3="50">-sama has come here―
{PAUSE ""}
I take it that it is because you have an interest in the stories that unfold in this world.<PG>
Of course, since I have come to welcome you and to guide you, that you will view the stories of this world is a great joy to me.<PG>
However, even the way a story advances has such a thing as an order.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "プレート" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MOTION "789" "立木三日" "3" "680" "3000" "DEC" "WAIT"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "プレート" "グラフィック\システム\立木三日プレート.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "180" "380" "600" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
The scenario <VAR NAME="プレイヤー名" unk3="50">-sama viewed just now, '<STYLE ID="1" RUBY="めいちょう">Meicho</STYLE> Arc [Clear Sign]　Dream Racing to the Past.'<PG>
This was a story you were originally meant to view much further on.<PG>
What is more, it is the last scenario of the '<STYLE ID="1" RUBY="めいちょう">Meicho</STYLE> Arc [Clear Sign],' and properly you were meant to view it not from the viewpoint of 'Natsumi <STYLE ID="2" RUBY="こごおり">Kogori</STYLE>' but from that of '<STYLE ID="3" RUBY="にいむらはるか">Haruka Niimura</STYLE>'...<PG>
This is because I was late in noticing your visit. 
{PAUSE ""}
From now on, I would like to guide you in the proper order.<PG>
Since it has worked out this way, I will leave the scenario you viewed as it is.<PG>
Depending on the story from here on, it may be interesting to reason out how things came to such an ending.<PG>
Now, I would like you to savor the stories of this world to your heart's content, but there is just one thing required of you.<PG>
That is, to witness the characters' happy ending. 
{PAUSE ""}
This is the sole duty required of you.<PG>
The stories that unfold in this world are, every one of them, cruel things smeared with blood and corpses, which only meet ghastly ends.<PG>
However, there is a road by which, miraculously, the characters can reach a happy ending.<PG>
Until you reach it, I expect you will be made to see many ghastly facts, but please, until you have witnessed their happy ending, I would like you to keep me company.<PG>
What is required of you is <STYLE ID="4" RUBY="・・">only</STYLE> to witness their happy ending.<PG>
So long as you fulfill that alone, nothing more will be required of you.<PG>
Therefore, knowing the truth of this story―
{PAUSE ""}
That is not required of you. 
{PAUSE ""}
If knowing the truth should stand in the way of their happy ending...<PG>
Is that understood? You have no need to know the truth, and the will to know the truth is against the rules.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
By no means forget it.<PG>
Now, the preamble has run long, but I will guide you into the story at once.<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
;---------------------------------------
; END DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------